{"id":"267fe4584e3c0212","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-tm.md","title":"Turing机的有限数据","display":"df-tm — Turing机的有限数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-tm","aliases":["43-df-tm"],"display":"df-tm — Turing机的有限数据","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.1, print pp.6–8 / PDF pp.26–28","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm — Turing机的有限数据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.1, print pp.6–8 / PDF pp.26–28"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\">\\(B\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\">\\(q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\)</span> 两两不同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\">\\(\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\)</span> 是不同的移动符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TM}\">\\(\\mathcal{TM}\\)</span> 为下式描述的机器集合；机器的执行及预言机版本另见本目录计算接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists Q,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\ \\Bigl(M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej})\\land Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|&lt;\\infty\\land\\{0,1,B\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land B\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}|=3\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists Q,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\ \\Bigl(M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej})\\land Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|&lt;\\infty\\land\\{0,1,B\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land B\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}|=3\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TM}:=\\{M:\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{TM}:=\\{M:\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此有限数据定义补全了旧文将TM同时当谓词和集合的混用。原书以标准Turing机执行为计算模型基础，本节点不声称单凭八元组已定义所有机器执行关系。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1, print pp.6–8 / PDF pp.26–28。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists Q,\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\ \\Bigl(M=(Q,\\{0,1\\},\\Gamma,B,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej})\\land Q,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land |Q|,|\\Gamma|<\\infty\\land\\{0,1,B\\}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land B\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\land\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land|\\{q_0,q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\}|=3\\land\\delta:(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\rm acc},q_{\\rm rej}\\})\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{TM}:=\\{M:\\operatorname{TM}(M)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1660,"backlinks":[{"id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-tm]] — Turing机的有限数据"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}